# Ping-Pong on STC89Cxx w/ PlatformIO

A ping-pong game written for STC89C52 and other 8051-based microcontrollers with PlatformIO + Modern coding style.

一个基于8051单片机的乒乓球游戏，使用现代化代码风格开发。

**CODE RESELLING IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED 严禁倒卖代码**

~~why are you reselling this dumb thing~~

## Features

- Modern code style with HAL from `` insert link here ``
- 2 Players, IRQ based input handling.
- Better gameplay experience, more details (what?)
- High precision design.

## Get started

1. Clone this repo.
2. Change headers to match your MCU.
3. Open this project in VS Code w/ PlatformIO.
4. Start playing around!

